scenarios.sourcePriceContent:
I need to procure [item/service name]. Please help me:
① Identify mainstream suppliers and brands with a pros/cons comparison;
② Research recent transaction price ranges for similar procurements;
③ Assess the creditworthiness of major suppliers and flag any risk signals or red flags.

scenarios.preBidCheckContent:
Please conduct a pre-bid compliance review of the following tender document, focusing on:
① Whether technical specs show brand preference or exclusionary clauses;
② Whether qualification requirements are disproportionate or non-compliant;
③ Whether the scoring criteria are fair and reasonable;
④ Any clauses that may trigger complaints or void the bidding process.

[Please paste the tender document content or upload the file]

scenarios.preAwardVerifyContent:
Please conduct a pre-award due diligence on the proposed winning supplier:
① Authenticity and compliance of declared past performance;
② Validity of key personnel qualifications and certificates;
③ Whether the supplier has affiliations with other bidders or collusion risks;
④ Bid price reasonableness — any dumping or bid-rigging concerns.

